        },
        {
          "text": "Emi ma fe anyapa otufinini bile isule rari, kani anzile anziri, kani afule rari, kani nzele piri, Yehova dri edetaru ku, emi ma ’ye angu eminia ’dini ku; ",
          "type": "text",
